/mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;Public (rate-limited)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GET /listings · GET /listings/{id} · GET /health (180/min)&lt;br&gt;POST /leads (10/min)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Logged-in&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;POST /listings (editor, 30/min) · POST /favorites&lt;br&gt;GET /owner/dashboard · POST /owner/listings/{id}/action (cookie + nonce)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Automation secret&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;POST /contact-authorization · /preferences · /consent · /opt-out · /automation-event&lt;br&gt;GET /approved-listings (72 h) · resend acknowledgement&lt;br&gt;POST /erase-lead (dedicated secret + anti-bruteforce)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="450" width="560" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;AJAX (admin-ajax.php)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;pk_submit_listing (nopriv) · pk_manage_listing · pk_sync_favorite · pk_favorites_list · pk_views_counter · listing preview · places autocomplete&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;admin-post actions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;pk_approve_listing · pk_resend_credentials · pk_verify_whatsapp · pk_place_decision · pk_places_import/reset · pk_grant/revoke_premium · pk_update_lead_followup · pk_export_leads · pk_save_customization · pk_save_n8n_settings" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="450" width="560" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
